ue de Lamassu IoT en AWS EC2 mediante la suscripción en AWS Marketplace",{"_9127":13,"_25351":11,"_5":25510,"_21542":36665,"_17356":36666,"_1875":36667},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/despliegue/cloud#despliegue-en-aws-ec2--aws-marketplace","Despliegue en AWS EC2 – AWS Marketplace",{"_9127":14,"_25351":11,"_5":25510,"_21542":36669,"_17356":36670,"_1875":36671},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/despliegue/cloud#pasos","Pasos",{"_9127":15,"_25351":11,"_5":25510,"_21542":36673,"_17356":36674,"_1875":36675},[],"/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/despliegue/cloud#requisitos-de-infraestructura","Requisitos de infraestructura",{"_9127":16,"_25351":11,"_21542":36677,"_5":25505,"_17356":36666,"_1875":36678},[],"Lamassu IoT está disponible en **AWS Marketplace**, lo que permite lanzar una instancia preconfigurada en AWS EC2 con un único clic.",{"_9127":17,"_25351":11,"_21542":36680,"_5":25505,"_17356":36670,"_1875":36681},[],"Acceder a la página del producto de Lamassu IoT en AWS Marketplace",{"_9127":18,"_25351":11,"_21542":36683,"_5":25505,"_17356":36670,"_1875":36684},[],"Seleccionar el tipo de instancia recomendado (`t3.large` o superior)",{"_9127":19,"_25351":11,"_21542":36686,"_5":25505,"_17356":36670,"_1875":36687},[],"Configurar el grupo de seguridad: puertos `443`, `8443` y `9443`",{"_9127":20,"_25351":11,"_21542":36689,"_5":25505,"_17356":36670,"_1875":36690},[],"Lanzar la instancia y acceder a la consola de administración en `https://<ip-publica>`",{"_9127":21,"_25351":11,"_21542":36692,"_5":25505,"_17356":36674,"_1875":36693},[],"Instancia EC2 `t3.large` mínimo (recomendado `t3.xlarge`)",{"_9127":22,"_25351":11,"_21542":36695,"_5":25505,"_17356":36674,"_1875":36696},[],"EBS `gp3` de al menos 50 GB",{"_9127":23,"_25351":11,"_21542":36698,"_5":25505,"_17356":36674,"_1875":36699},[],"Security Group con acceso HTTPS desde los dispositivos IoT",{"_9127":24,"_25351":24,"_5":25500,"_1875":36658,"_25513":36701,"_21542":36702,"_17356":24},[36657,36658],[],{"_9127":25,"_25351":24,"_21542":36704,"